      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that consumes internet memes and is familiar with Islamophobic stereotypes, particularly those that portray Muslims as sexually aggressive or predatory. The target audience likely includes individuals who are exposed to or propagate hate speech, conspiracy theories, or xenophobic content online, and who may find humor or satisfaction in degrading portrayals of Muslim communities. The meme’s format and content are tailored to provoke fear and hostility toward Muslims, suggesting the audience is predisposed to or seeks out such content.",
